# What goes where

**Types/interfaces and static content live in different places. Do not mix them.**

## Types and interfaces → `types/` (or `lib/` for module-specific)

| Kind                     | File                   | Example                                       |
| ------------------------ | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Domain models            | `types/data.ts`        | `Product`, `Collection`, `EnquiryFormPayload` |
| Component props          | `types/components.ts`  | `ProductCardProps`, `HeroSliderProps`         |
| Page params/searchParams | `types/data.ts`        | `CollectionDetailPageProps`                   |
| Catalog pipeline types   | `lib/catalog/index.ts` | `GeneratedProductDef`                         |

- Import shared types via `@/types` (barrel in `types/index.ts`).
- **Do not** add `export type` / `export interface` to `constants/`.
- File-private types (not reused) may stay inline in the file that uses them only.
- New reusable interface → add to `types/data.ts` or `types/components.ts`, not a new top-level `interfaces/` folder.

## Static content and config → `constants/`

| Kind | File | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Site copy, nav, labels | `constants/site.ts` | `SITE`, menus, page titles |
| Routes | `constants/routes.ts` | `ROUTES`, `collectionPath()` |
| Collection metadata | `constants/collections.ts` | `COLLECTION_DEFS`, `COLLECTIONS` |
| Layout / image sizes / motion IDs | `constants/layout.ts`, `timing.ts` | `IMAGE_SIZES`, `TIMING` |
| Editorial content arrays | `constants/hero.ts`, `press.ts`, `couture.ts`, … | slides, press quotes |

- **Hand-authored** strings, numbers, arrays, and image path helpers belong here.
- Pages/components read config from `constants/` or via `lib/data` getters — never hardcode in JSX.

## Other locations (not `constants/` or `types/`)

| Kind                                     | Location                                        |
| ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Auto-generated from disk                 | `generated/` — never edit                       |
| Env-based values (email, phone)          | `lib/contact.ts`                                |
| Pure logic (validation, SEO, email HTML) | `lib/validation.ts`, `lib/seo.ts`, `lib/email/` |
| Runtime content access                   | `lib/data/` getters                             |

## Quick decision

- **Shape of data** (interface/type) → `types/` or `lib/catalog/`
- **Actual copy, routes, flags, image lists** → `constants/`
- **Built from folders by script** → `generated/`
